WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.667
Everyone was in a spaceship.

2
00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:09.094
"Bot can be our pilot," Ringo said.

3
00:00:09.095 --> 00:00:13.536
"She's great at flying."

4
00:00:13.537 --> 00:00:20.170
"I'm the pilot today, Tiny," Lucy said.

5
00:00:20.171 --> 00:00:23.020
"You and Bot sit back there.

6
00:00:23.021 --> 00:00:27.431
PJ, find a signal from the satellite."

7
00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:30.855
"Oh!" Ringo said.

8
00:00:30.856 --> 00:00:33.817
"Bot and I can do that!"

9
00:00:33.818 --> 00:00:37.023
"PJ will do it," Lucy said.

10
00:00:37.024 --> 00:00:41.245
"He's smarter and faster than you two.

11
00:00:41.246 --> 00:00:44.234
Right, PJ?"

12
00:00:44.235 --> 00:00:48.194
Boong! PJ lit up a map.

13
00:00:48.195 --> 00:00:51.749
"I found the satellite's signal," PJ said.

14
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.182
"It's near Planet Crud."

15
00:00:55.183 --> 00:01:00.247
"Let's go!" Lucy said.

16
00:01:00.248 --> 00:01:07.874
The spaceship took off.

17
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:11.732
"I know about Planet Crud," Bot said.

18
00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:16.065
Ringo nodded. "Bot knows a lot."

19
00:01:16.066 --> 00:01:21.271
"Yes. Planet Crud has junkyards," Bot said.

20
00:01:21.272 --> 00:01:27.187
Lucy yawned.

21
00:01:27.188 --> 00:01:30.201
Then she looked at PJ.

22
00:01:30.202 --> 00:01:33.986
"I wish they weren't here," Lucy said.

23
00:01:33.987 --> 00:01:36.970
"We don't need their help, right?"

24
00:01:36.971 --> 00:01:39.219
PJ didn't answer.

25
00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:41.287
PJ looked at Bot.

26
00:01:41.288 --> 00:01:44.674
"What else does Planet Crud have?" he asked.

27
00:01:44.675 --> 00:01:48.226
Bot lit up. "There are garbage dumps.

28
00:01:48.227 --> 00:01:50.449
And we must watch out for—"

29
00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.911
"Boring!" Lucy said.

30
00:01:53.912 --> 00:02:09.327
"Let's listen to music."

